OL,3,AFrench police fire tear gas at school
OL,4,Aprotesters as officer charged over
OL,5,Astudent hit by projectile
OL,6,
OL,7,FTens of thousands of people are
OL,8,Fdemonstrating across France, in protest
OL,9,Fat what they say is under-investment in
OL,10,Fhigh schools
OL,12,FOne union says 2,000 high schools have
OL,13,Fclosed - France's interior ministry
OL,14,Festimates more than 250,000 protesters
OL,15,Fhave demonstrated across France
OL,17,FAn officer has been charged after a boy
OL,18,Fwas hit by a projectile during protests
OL,19,Fnear Paris last week, as debate rages
OL,20,Fover police force
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
