OL,3,AFrench police fire tear gas at school
OL,4,Aprotesters as officer charged over
OL,5,Astudent hit by projectile
OL,6,
OL,7,FToday police have fired tear gas across
OL,8,Fthe country, including in the capital
OL,9,Fand Marseille - our reporter there says
OL,10,Fhe can "feel it in my throat and eyes"
OL,12,FIn Lyon, a barricade was set on fire;
OL,13,Fwhile in Rennes, police used water
OL,14,Fcannon. In Paris, one 17-year-old tells
OL,15,Fus she studies in "overcrowded" classes
OL,16,Fof 35
OL,18,FIn parliament, French Prime Minister
OL,19,FSebastian Lecornu says: "Burning down a
OL,20,Fhigh school does not improve the state
OL,21,Fof high school buildings"
